stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : POST /submissions

    PENDING --> PROCESSING : worker берёт из Kafka
    PROCESSING --> SUCCESS : passed = total
    PROCESSING --> PARTIAL_SUCCESS : 0 < passed < total
    PROCESSING --> FAILED : passed = 0,<br/>все тесты WA/RTE/TLE
    PROCESSING --> ERROR : внутренняя ошибка,<br/>таймаут sandbox<br/>или AI

    SUCCESS --> [*]
    PARTIAL_SUCCESS --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    ERROR --> [*]
